=== bakedanuki_r1 ===
That's it. No more night-time customers, no more overly complicated orders, and no more surprises! #speaker: Me
I admit, I'm losing it <i>a bit</i>, but hey, the only craziness I was expecting tonight was a few sore limbs from lifting boxes. #speaker: Me
Be it unicorn, minotaur, or mermaid, <i>I don't care!</i> #speaker: Me
Halloween is tomorrow folks! <i>Tomorrow!</i> #speaker: Me
I <i>will</i> go home and get some <i>sleep!</i> #speaker: Me
WE. ARE. CLOSED! #speaker: Me
A-Achoo! #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
A little creature stares wide-eyed at me, nose running slightly, and paws trembling.
They're the cutest thing I've ever seen in all my life, and I just yelled at them like they were nothing more than annoying <i>pest.</i>
O-Oh my god! I was just angry and- I shouldn't have yelled! #speaker: Me
The creature, who looks like a perfect mix between a dog and a racoon, blinks up at me, not saying a word.
A-Are you alright? #speaker: Me
Yes. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
The softest, sweetest sound graces my ears.
So adorable!
Oh, thank goodness! Please accept my apologies! #speaker: Me
What is happening right now? It's like they have a hypnotic hold on my brain. I would die for them.
Ok. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
Yup. Would totally die for them.
Are you cold? Do you need a blanket or something? #speaker: Me
The creature shakes their head.
No. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
I have thick fur, I'm ok. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
They're obviously not ok as I watch them shiver all over. Whatever they are, they sure need something to stop that chill.
Can I get you something to eat? O-On the house of course! #speaker: Me
The creature falls silent, looking a bit perplexed.
On the house? #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
Yes! That means you don't have to pay! #speaker: Me
It wouldn't hurt to feed just one more little critter, I mean... just look at them!
Ok. On the house. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
I beam as I grab my notepad and pen. Somehow, going home doesn't seem so important now.
So, what can I get you? #speaker: Me
I crave something I can easily hold in my hand, filled with the sweetness of nature. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
Foraging along the trees in autumn, I like to pick these off the ground. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
So hungry...Please hurry. #speaker: Cute Racoon-Dog!
Ah, yes right away! #speaker: Me
Gosh, that was a bit cryptic, but I'll do my very best!
