=== game_end ===
Whew what a night!
If I wasn't so stressed I would think I just dreamed all this up...
I guess it's true what Grandma used to say about nights in this town. I always thought they were just tall tales.
After all that's happened tonight, I can honestly say that I...
* [Hated it!]
    Never want to stay open this late again!
    Just normal waking hours, with normal human people, who have the decency to not mess up my entire sense of life.
    I'm going home, jumping into bed, and forgetting any of this ever happened! #speaker: Me
* [Loved it!]
    Actually, really enjoyed it!
    I know I was so hung up on sleep, but now that it's all settled in, I feel like I've discovered something new about the world.
    We're not the only ones living in it, and not the only ones who enjoy a cozy baked good.
    Maybe I should start extending my hours... #speaker: Me
- -> END
